flowchart TB
    User[Browser] --> Ingress[Ingress controller]
    User --> Gateway[Gateway controller<br/>Existing Gateway]
    Gateway --> Listener[Optional chart ListenerSet]
    Listener --> Route[HTTPRoute]
    Gateway -->|Direct attachment| Route
    Route --> Svc[Dashboard Service - 5601]
    Ingress --> Svc
    Svc --> UI[Dashboard HTTP or HTTPS]
    Edge[Optional edge TLS Secret] -.-> Listener
    Policy[BackendTLSPolicy<br/>CA ConfigMap] -. HTTPS backend trust .-> Svc
